# Expense Tracker

A full-stack Expense Tracker application built using Spring Boot and Angular.

This project is being developed from scratch as a learning project with a focus on understanding software design, backend development, REST APIs, and frontend integration instead of following tutorials.

## Tech Stack

### Backend
- Java
- Spring Boot
- Spring Data JPA
- MySQL
- Maven
- Lombok

### Frontend
- Angular (Coming Soon)

## Current Features

- Spring Boot project setup
- MySQL configuration
- Expense entity
- Category enum
- Payment Method enum

## Project Status

🚧 Under Development

## Learning Goals

- REST API Design
- Database Modeling
- Spring Boot Best Practices
- Angular Integration
- Clean Architecture
- Git & GitHub Workflow

## Future Features

- CRUD APIs
- Search
- Filters
- Monthly Reports
- Dashboard
- Authentication
- Charts

